      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "How do you bake SpeedTrees? They can't be baked, coz they are using some kind of billboards for leaves (non static).\nAnyway, I've try to do that and for me speedtrees become very dark in Unity after baking, and I wasn't able to fix that.\np.s. I don't think it's VRChat-related bug.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
