      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In the past (cant vouch for current) I was able to bake Speedtree models, but it required disabling the LOD system on the tree and using just the base mesh. I also had to switch to standard shader for them, as I think the speedtree shader does not support it. \n\nGenerally speaking thought I leave speedtree to Lightprobes. I have a 2nd static copy if I need to for baking just the shadows.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
